  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man with a retro appearance (curly hair, glasses, 80s-style clothing) sitting at a desk with an old beige computer, holding a mug and smiling. The text overlay reads: 'when you max out intelligence and put nothing on agility.' The overall intent is to humorously stereotype a person who is highly intelligent but lacks physical agility or athleticism. This is a lighthearted, self-deprecating or satirical meme that uses a visual of a 'nerdy' or 'geeky' figure to represent someone who prioritizes intellectual prowess over physical prowess. The meme does not target any specific protected group or community with harmful intent. It is a general, non-toxic joke about perceived personality traits, using a common trope of contrasting intelligence with physical ability. The humor is derived from the juxtaposition of the image (a person who appears studious or bookish) with the text (a commentary on prioritizing intelligence over agility). There is no abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda content. The intent is purely comedic and satirical, playing on a common cultural stereotype without targeting any specific group.",
